    Seed("Dumbbell Pullover", "Lie perpendicular across a bench with only the upper back supported, holding one dumbbell with both hands above the chest. Lower the weight in an arc behind your head with slightly bent arms until a stretch is felt, then pull it back over the chest. Trains the chest, lats and serratus anterior through a long range of motion.", "strength", "chest", listOf("lats", "triceps"), "dumbbell"),
